					}
				},
				{
					type: "text",
					content: "Vibrant greens! Rushing streams! Giant dinosaurs! Cascade Kingdom is an idyllic paradise of the past, with a slew of  prehistoric reptiles roaming the fields. Adorning the grassy mountains are fossilised remains of those that once resided here and vast rushing rivers and waterfalls. Whether you visit the imposing Fossil Falls, the mystical Aldegara Waterfall, the enchanting Fairy Forest, or just chill with the Yoshis, you will remember this trip for life.",
					alignContent: "left",
				},
				{
					type: "horizontal-rule",
				},
				{
					type: "image-right",
					title: "Fossil Falls",
					titleColor: "#b18f01",
					titleOnTop: true,
					image: "fossil_falls_concept.jpg",
					caption: "Fossil Falls Concept Art",
					content: "The central landmark of the triceratops-shaped landmass, is an impressive display of the enormity of the Kingdom. Connected to the Cap Kingdom by a spark pylon, the kingdom has strange ruins of airships Bonneters once flew. One of these ruins becomes the iconic ship The Odyssey. Here you can find the intimidating T-Rexes snoozing in the sun."
				},
				{
					type: "image",
