					caption: "Wario looking at the Aldegara Waterfall",
					alignCaption: "center",
				},
			],

			right: [
				{
					type: "text",
					title: "Dinosaur Land",
					titleColor: "#b18f01",
					content: "Off the coast of the main continent is a small archipelago inhabited by many dinosaurs, most famously Yoshi! Here you will find a host of creatures including Blarggs, dino-Rhinos, Dino-Torches, Eeries, Rexes and Reznors. In Super Mario World, this is the vacation spot of Mario and his friends.",
					alignContent: "left",
				},
				{
					type: "image",
