					type: "horizontal-rule",
				},
				{
					type: "text",
					title: "Retro Beginnings",
					content: "This here is where Mario took up his first jobs! As a carpenter Mario fought Donkey Kong; then he and Luigi worked in a bottling plant; before proceeding to work in a Cement Factory; next serving in the military; a brief stint as part of a Wrecking Crew; until eventually settling in his role as a plumber - cleaning the pipes of the city.",
					alignContent: "left",
				},
